.el .ds Aq '
.TH ferry-config 1  Ferry "Ferry Manual"
.SH NAME
ferry\-config \- Show or change settings (`ferry config list`, `get`, `set`, `unset`, `path`)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBferry config\fR [\fB\-\-lang\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show or change settings (`ferry config list`, `get`, `set`, `unset`, `path`)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-lang\fR \fI<CODE>\fR
Interface language for this run (`en`, `pl`); overrides the saved setting
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
ferry\-config\-list(1)
Show every setting
.TP
ferry\-config\-get(1)
Show one setting
.TP
ferry\-config\-set(1)
Change one setting
.TP
ferry\-config\-unset(1)
Reset one setting to its default
.TP
ferry\-config\-path(1)
Print the path of the configuration file
